n un Super Saiyajin Dios.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12029671/screencap/6af099f7e09d4.jpg","released":"2026-11-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt39395275:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"6. La Batalla de los Dioses","overview":"Ante el poder abrumador de Beerus, Goku enfrenta un peligro absoluto. ¿Cómo terminará la batalla por el destino de la Tierra?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12029672/screencap/6af9ce232b336.jpg","released":"2026-11-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt39395275:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"7. Resurrección \"F\"","overview":"Aunque la Tierra se salvó de Beerus gracias a Goku, una nueva amenaza se acerca.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/12029673/screencap/6b0307d38542c.jpg","released":"2026-11-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt39395275:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"8. Venganza \"F\"","released":"2026-11-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt39395275:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"9. Episode 9","released":"2026-12-06T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt39395275:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"10. Episode 10","released":"2026-12-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt39395275:1:11","season":1,"episode":11,"title":"11. Episode 11","released":"2026-12-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"},{"id":"tt39395275:1:12","season":1,"episode":12,"title":"12. Episode 12","released":"2026-12-27T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"23 min"}]}}